{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act23side_level_act23side_04_beg",
  "groupId": "act23side",
  "stageId": "act23side_04",
  "title": "不念往昔",
  "storyCode": "WB-4",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "288b79fe2d296af0f1367e8eb969d33e565e8a8702cbfc3bf86ec72128c416a0",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "text": "孟叔，孟叔，你在里面吗？我有话要问你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "text": "我是杜遥夜！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "附近的游侠",
      "text": "姑娘，别敲了，没看见门口挂的牌子啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "附近的游侠",
      "text": "晚饭时候门就关了，你有啥事明天再来吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "附近的游侠",
      "text": "嘿，怎么还不理人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "text": "孟叔！你是不是有事瞒着我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "text": "再不答应，我就自己进去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "附近的游侠",
      "text": "又来一个......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "附近的游侠",
      "text": "现在的年轻人怎么都大半夜往铁匠铺跑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "嗯？行裕客栈郑掌柜的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "text": "你是之前找过爹的那个年轻官差？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "杜小姐何时来的玉门？此刻出现在这里又所为何事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "text": "找人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "text": "你又是来干嘛的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "查案。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "text": "官府查到铸剑坊，难道孟叔他真的做了什么事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "听杜小姐的语气，这里果真有问题......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "text": "是我在问你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "倘若杜小姐和此事无关，还请不要耽误在下查案。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "text": "谁在耽误谁......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "刀光硬生生截断了杜遥夜的话头。\n门锁落下，“暂停营业”的牌子碎成两半，左乐已经冲进了铸剑坊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "附近的游侠",
      "text": "（孟大哥只是让我盯着些，想不到真有人来闹事。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "附近的游侠",
      "text": "（不行，得去叫人来帮忙。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "text": "你干什么！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "text": "跟你说话呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "text": "打你怎么了！官差就是这么查案的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "出来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "进。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "鲤先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "刚看到槐琥跑了出去，风风火火的，我喊她都没答应。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "毕竟才刚大学毕业，正是一腔热血的年纪，难免头脑简单，雨霞姑娘多教教她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "鲤先生的员工，哪儿轮得到我来指手画脚。是我给她添麻烦了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "哪儿的话。年轻人嘛，多长长见识，也是好事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "凭那孩子的身手，就算遇到几个坏人，也用不着担心就是了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "昨天晚上，爸他找过鲤先生，是有事情找您帮忙？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "也谈不上帮忙......只是在找人的时候顺便听到了一些故事，侦探的耳朵总是灵一点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "要是能对雨霞姑娘查案有帮助，那就再好不过了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "鲤先生请坐，讲故事总不能站着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "让我想想该从何说起......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "打个比方，如果魏彦吾和令尊不合，那龙门会变成什么样子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“天灾当前，城里又有山海众作乱，将军亲自带兵镇守城门，哪有工夫见一个百姓？”\n“我听说这个人以前和将军认识。”\n“还是通报一下吧，万一他真有什么事呢？”\n......\n“你上去吧，将军同意见你。”\n“他就在城楼上。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "夜已经很深了。\n军用源石射灯嵌进城墙，随台阶一路上铺，周围明亮得像是白昼。\n但孟铁衣走得很慢，身后的军士也没有催他。\n他已经十多年没有登上玉门的城楼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "见过平祟侯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "text": "......你就直接说明来意吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "希望平祟侯能批准我出城。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "信使队伍出了事，听说尸骨都没剩下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "队伍里有铸剑坊的几位兄弟，总得有人去接他们。起码也该在他们身死的地方，洒一坛酒，捧几抔沙回来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "text": "来人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军",
      "text": "将军。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "text": "封城的命令，是否已经下达到了全城？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军",
      "text": "......是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "text": "你听到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "所以我才来找平祟侯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "text": "绝无可能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军",
      "text": "这位师傅，玉门正在高速移动，一日几十里，外面是茫茫戈壁，现在就算放你出城也没有用......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "text": "多嘴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "是啊，玉门已经走得太远了，沙漠风大，兄弟们要怎么找回来？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "text": "逝者已矣，但玉门前行，不容耽搁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "text": "杀害信使团队的贼寇已潜入城中，现在全城戒严，早日将他们一网打尽，也能告慰亡者的在天之灵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "既然如此，还请平祟侯恩准我们一起追查凶手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "这阵子城里人员混杂，我们这些跑江湖的，总能帮得上忙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "text": "捉拿凶手，护卫玉门，玉门军人职责所在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "text": "如果还要劳烦百姓，是左某无能了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "text": "你来找我，就为了此事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "录武官",
      "text": "于空中出剑，力道凌厉无匹，竟然能强行收住劲头。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "录武官",
      "text": "羽兽凌江，衔鳞而起，水面只留下涟漪点点。师姐发劲收劲，又到了新的境界。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "录武官",
      "text": "师姐可否再演示一遍？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "除非你能让刚刚那只受惊的小沙地兽再蹿出来一次。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "录武官",
      "text": "......倒是不能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "所谓招式，不过是把人的反应抽象归整，方便理解。人的反应哪里有定数，武功的精妙都在临场的变化里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "你记录天下武学，别老跟一招一式过不去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "录武官",
      "text": "“形”是躯壳，“意”是精神，老师很早就教导过我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "人哪，有些事情明明知道，但总是改不掉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "你也是太呆了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "录武官",
      "text": "好像是千夫长在集结军队。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "足足一个百人队，好大的阵仗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军",
      "text": "千夫长，队伍已经集结完毕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫长",
      "text": "清点装备，跟我前往城南铸剑坊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫长",
      "text": "原来是仇姑娘和录武官小哥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "千夫长现在整兵，难道是发现了山海众的行踪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫长",
      "text": "太合御史在铸剑坊附近被人重伤，左乐公子命我带兵清查铸剑坊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "行动通报了平祟侯没有？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫长",
      "text": "将军现在镇守外城楼，昨天已经授权给公子，三日内可以调度他的亲兵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "有直接证据证明是铸剑坊干的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫长",
      "text": "具体的还不清楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "左乐人呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫长",
      "text": "公子已经先一步过去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫长",
      "text": "太合御史受伤，他很着急。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "关门闭户，歹人聚集，好个铸剑坊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴险的山海众成员",
      "text": "人不在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴险的山海众成员",
      "text": "居然和秉烛人暗中往来，姓孟的果然不可信。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "text": "天灾数据还在姓孟的身上，去把他找出来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "text": "先解决对面这两个娃娃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "text": "你们到底是什么人？孟叔呢？他是遭了你们的毒手，还是和你们一伙？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "text": "大小齐又在哪里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "text": "不说话？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "text": "那就打到你们说话为止......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "刀光从杜遥夜身旁掠过，左乐踏步向前。\n他一言不发，刀挥得很快，眉头皱得很紧。\n这是杜遥夜今天第二次被截断话头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "text": "混账——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴险的山海众成员",
      "text": "什么人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这里不能被毁掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "text": "你们住手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "text": "院子里的东西都被打坏了，要打出去打！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴险的山海众成员",
      "text": "居然还藏着帮手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "text": "（嘶——）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "text": "这把剑怎么会在她身上......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴险的山海众成员",
      "text": "头儿，这女娃身上有伤！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "text": "先解决她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "像是突然起了一阵风，满院的细沙被搅起，人影交错。\n受伤的异族少女捂着伤口后退，靠在老槐树上用力喘息。她没有注意到杜遥夜的靠近。\n蒙面的凶徒再次隐入屋檐边的阴影。\n年轻的秉烛人走到庭院中间，将两个少女挡在身后。他的腰间不知何时多出来一把剑，被暗扣牢牢锁住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "text": "我的剑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "肩上什么时候空的？刚刚的冲击......\n一截断裂的皮料落在地上。那是族人用猎到的动物毛皮制成的束带，坚韧耐磨，用来绑剑再合适不过。\n绑那柄她一刻也不曾离身的剑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "这是宗师的佩剑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "既然你与山海众并无勾结，剑现在在我手里，权且算你物归原主。擅闯军营的罪责，之后再追究。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "text": "......你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "text": "还给我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "text": "你是谁？你不要拉我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "text": "你的伤不轻，我警告你不要乱动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "text": "我不管那把剑什么情况。但你既然早就藏在铸剑坊里，说明你认识孟铁衣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "text": "还请告诉我，他现在去了哪里？你有没有在铸剑坊里看见两个尚蜀年轻人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "text": "要是不说，我会在你的伤口上再补一拳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴险的山海众成员",
      "text": "看来这几个家伙并不是一起的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴险的山海众成员",
      "text": "外面的人，封好出口，别让他们有路跑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴险的山海众成员",
      "text": "听到没有？回话！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "声音近在咫尺。他慌忙回头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "疼痛随着自己的移动而越发清晰，清晰得就像那个断成两截的通讯工具。\n他没来得及后悔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "仇姐姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "外面的已经解决了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "text": "！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "和先前在集市袭击你的是同一拨人。山海众？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "鲁莽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "你不止是武艺没有长进......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "等拿了这伙人，我再听仇姐姐教训！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "......等等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "刚才还没察觉，只是出了几剑，手心竟然已经生汗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "这间院子......这个温度......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "好像越来越热了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "如今只到三月份，也还没看见太阳，气温怎么反而在升高？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "难道是铸剑坊的源石锻造炉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "炉火早就熄了 。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "气愤的山海众成员",
      "text": "头儿，她伤了我们好几个人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "text": "别再浪费时间了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你们还知道浪费了时间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "三月中，这个时节会有蝉鸣吗？\n空气中的湿意沉沉地压下来，黏腻透衣，这绝不是早春的露。\n在场所有人都感受到了异样。\n一滴水落在仇白的脸上。\n北地春来迟，老槐还来不及长出新叶——\n这是刀刃凝出的水珠！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "text": "先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众首领",
      "text": "孟铁衣呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "text": "不在铸剑坊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "text": "我们正准备离开，就遇上了这几个人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "这把刀......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "就是你伤了太合叔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
